  "Title": "Pre-Congress Workshops",
  "NewsSubTitle": "40th Annual Congress of Ophthalmology 2019",
  "NewsSummary": "International speakers and participants from across Pakistan attended this, the 40th \"KarOphth\" Congress, with preceeding workshops on Neuro-Ophthalmic Emergencies, Fundoscopy Simulation, Refractive Surgery with simulator, and with wet-lab.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass54D735BB599349CBAAD38736667F14B3\"><p>International speakers and participants from across Pakistan attended this, the 40th \"KarOphth\" Congress in August, with preceeding workshops on Neuro-Ophthalmic Emergencies, Fundoscopy Simulation, Refractive Surgery with simulator, and with wet-lab.&#160;<br></p><p>Recent advances in ophthalmology were highlighted by our world class faculty, international &amp; national speakers and the whole event was well evaluated by participants.</p></div>",
